Materials are items which can be used to make [[Deliveries|deliveries]]. they can be acquired by interacting with '''Foraging sites''' which are set glowing spot dispatched around the [[Overworld|overworld]]. Once collected, the spot becomes yellowish and replenish after a few battles. They can also be automatically collected at the end of each battles by stationing a guard in neighboring towns and cities.

Each Region has it's own unique materials which are exclusive to their region. These unique material can be distinguished by the following categories : 
* Wood
* Stone
* Herb
* Sea Fish
* River Fish
* Ore
* Specialty
